{"t":"KHC","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"The Kraft Heinz Company","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","employees":35000,"hq":"Pittsburgh, PA, United States","website":"https://www.kraftheinzcompany.com","summary_en":"The Kraft Heinz Company, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and markets food and beverage products in North America and internationally. Its products include condiments, sauces, dressings, and spreads; cheese, frozen potato products, and other frozen meals; meal kits, frozen snacks, and pickles; dry packaged desserts, refrigerated ready to eat desserts, and other dessert toppings; ready to drink and powdered beverages, and liquid concentrates; American sliced and recipe cheeses; mainstream coffee, coffee pods, and premium coffee; and cold cuts, bacon, and hot dogs. It offers its products under the Kraft, Oscar Mayer, Heinz, Philadelphia, Lunchables, Velveeta, Ore-Ida, Capri Sun, Maxwell House, Kool-Aid, Jell-O, ABC, Master, Quero, Golden Circle, Wattie's, Pudliszki, and Plasmon brands, as well as Bagel Bites, Claussen, A1, and Cool Whip. It sells its products through its own sales organizations, as well as through independent brokers, agents, and distributors to chain, wholesale, cooperative, and independent grocery accounts; convenience, value, and club stores; pharmacies and drug stores; mass merchants; foodservice distributors; institutions, including hotels, restaurants, bakeries, hospitals, health care facilities, and government agencies; and various e-commerce platforms and retailers. The company has a strategic partnership with the National Football League. The company was formerly known as H.J. Heinz Holding Corporation and changed its name to The Kraft Heinz Company in July 2015. The company was founded in 1869 and is headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Kraft Heinz Company는 자회사와 함께 북미 및 국제적으로 식품 및 음료 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 해당 제품에는 조미료, 소스, 드레싱 및 스프레드가 포함됩니다. 치즈, 냉동 감자 제품 및 기타 냉동 식품; 식사 키트, 냉동 스낵, 피클; 건조 포장된 디저트, 냉장 보관된 바로 먹을 수 있는 디저트 및 기타 디저트 토핑; 바로 마실 수 있는 음료, 분말 음료, 액상 농축액; 미국산 슬라이스 치즈와 레시피 치즈; 주류 커피, 커피 포드 및 프리미엄 커피; 냉햄, 베이컨, 핫도그. Kraft, Oscar Mayer, Heinz, Philadelphia, Lunchables, Velveeta, Ore-Ida, Capri Sun, Maxwell House, Kool-Aid, Jell-O, ABC, Master, Quero, Golden Circle, Wattie's, Pudliszki 및 Plasmon 브랜드는 물론 Bagel Bites, Claussen, A1 및 Cool Whip으로 제품을 제공합니다. 자체 판매 조직은 물론 독립 브로커, 대리인 및 유통업체를 통해 체인, 도매, 협동조합 및 독립 식료품 계정으로 제품을 판매합니다. 편의점, 가치 및 클럽 매장; 약국 및 약국; 대량 상인; 식품 서비스 유통업체; 호텔, 레스토랑, 빵집, 병원, 의료 시설 및 정부 기관을 포함한 기관; 다양한 전자상거래 플랫폼과 소매업체 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 National Football League와 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 있습니다. 이 회사의 이전 이름은 H.J. Heinz Holding Corporation은 2015년 7월 이름을 The Kraft Heinz Company로 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1869년에 설립되었으며 펜실베니아주 피츠버그에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":24.175,"mcap":28619065344.0,"pe":null,"fpe":11.734809,"peg":2.7958,"ps":1.1550192,"pb":0.795649,"ev_ebitda":8.356,"div":6.55,"beta":0.103,"hi52":28.09,"lo52":21.035},"fin":{"rev":24778000384.0,"rev_g":-0.02,"eps_g":-0.117,"gross":0.33651,"op":0.16468,"net":-0.13992,"roe":-0.08953,"fcf":3191375104.0,"cash":1904000000.0,"debt":18002999296.0,"de":49.884,"eps":-2.93,"feps":2.06011},"own":{"short":0.113800004,"inst":0.67383003,"insider":0.27825},"analyst":{"n":17,"mean":25.14706,"median":24.0,"high":41.0,"low":20.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":3.05263,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":4},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":4},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":4},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":4}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":26.0,"priorPriceTarget":24.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main"